1104 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Wolters Kluwer\nSenior Product Designer\nJun 2021 \055 Jul 2026  \055  Internacional \055 Remote\n\nDesigned and shipped complex B2B SaaS products for accounting and professional\055services firms\054 translating business logic\054 regulatory requirements and technical constraints into scalable product experiences across international markets\056\n\nOwned end\055to\055end product design from discovery\054 customer research and problem definition through interaction design\054 prototyping\054 validation\054 design delivery and implementation\056\nDesigned and shipped AI\055powered product experiences\054 including an AI agent integrated into the product ecosystem to support users within their existing workflows\056\nTranslated complex business rules\054 operational dependencies\054 regional requirements and technical constraints into clear and scalable user experiences\056\nContributed to the evolution of a global Design System\054 defining reusable interaction patterns and improving consistency and accessibility across products\056\nPartnered closely with Product\054 Engineering\054 Architecture\054 Business Experts and international stakeholders to define product direction\054 resolve cross\055product dependencies and deliver solutions into production\056\nUsed research\054 prototyping and usability validation to de\055risk product decisions and align stakeholders across different markets\056\nApplied AI\055assisted design and coding workflows to accelerate exploration\054 prototyping\054 design delivery and collaboration with Engineering\056\n\n\nFrog\nSenior Product Designer \nFeb 2019 \055 Jun 2021 \055  Madrid\n\nDesigned multi\055device digital products and connected experiences across Telef\363nica\047s mobile\054 TV and smart\055home ecosystem\054 working across iOS\054 Android\054 TV and web\055based operational tools\056\n\n Led end\055to\055end design delivery\054 from IA and interaction design to high\055fidelity UI\054 responsive layouts\054 prototypes and implementation\055ready specs\056\n Designed web\055based operational tools\054 including a CMS and partner dashboard for Living Apps\056\n Collaborated with Product\054 Engineering\054 Research and Business to balance user needs\054 business goals and technical feasibility\056\n\n\nFreelance experience\nFront\055end and Graphic Design\n\nDesigned and built responsive digital experiences\054 combining UX\057UI design\054 front\055end development and implementation to take concepts from idea to working product\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 1105 0 R
     /Pg 1070 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

